 33: /** @file Definition of platform independent string workers:
 34:    ASSIMP_itoa10
 35:    ASSIMP_stricmp
 36:    ASSIMP_strincmp
 37:    These functions are not consistently available on all platforms,
 38:    or the provided implementations behave too differently.
