1598: // Triangulate concave polygons. Based on "Triangulation by Ear Clipping" paper, O(N^2) complexity.
1599: // Reference: https://www.geometrictools.com/Documentation/TriangulationByEarClipping.pdf
1600: // Provided as a convenience for user but not used by main library.
